  "slug": "yoga-bhashya",
  "title": "The Yoga Sutras with the Bhashya attributed to Vyasa",
  "originalTitle": "पातञ्जलयोगशास्त्र",
  "transliteration": "Pātañjalayogaśāstra",
  "altTitles": [
